{"id":67472,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67472"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:30:33","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:30:33","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-fatima","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-fatima\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026<\/strong> (1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>5 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), na cidade de <strong>F\u00e1tima<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Our\u00e9m<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>). Com zona de partida e chegada instalada junto \u00e0 <strong>Igreja e Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de F\u00e1tima<\/strong>, a prova estreia-se no calend\u00e1rio nacional de corridas de final de ano com partidas noturnas \u00e0s <strong>19:00<\/strong> (10 km) e \u00e0s <strong>19:10<\/strong> (5 km).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra duas corridas competitivas cronometradas por chip eletr\u00f3nico: a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (Prova Elite FPA inserida no Circuito Regional de Estrada da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m, com partida \u00e0s 19:00 e limite de 2 horas) e a <strong>Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 19:10 e limite de 1 hora). O circuito urbano percorre locais emblem\u00e1ticos de F\u00e1tima, incluindo a Avenida D. Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva, o Recinto do Santu\u00e1rio de F\u00e1tima, a Bas\u00edlica da Sant\u00edssima Trindade e a Igreja Paroquial.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>FTT \u2013 F\u00e1tima Trail Team<\/strong> com o apoio institucional do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m<\/strong>, Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima, Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m e Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo, a prova tem cariz solid\u00e1rio, revertendo 2,00 \u20ac de cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o a favor dos <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de F\u00e1tima<\/strong>. Inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial (nas 1\u00aa e 2\u00aa fases), medalha finisher, seguro, abastecimentos e refor\u00e7o alimentar final. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Igreja e Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de F\u00e1tima, Our\u00e9m, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transfor