12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida da S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 1\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, com aquecimento coletivo \u00e0s 18:45, partida da Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 19:00 e partida da Corrida de 5 km \u00e0s 19:10.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localizam a partida, a chegada e o secretariado da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A zona de partida e chegada situa-se junto \u00e0 Igreja e Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de F\u00e1tima, no concelho de Our\u00e9m (distrito de Santar\u00e9m). O levantamento de dorsais decorre na sexta-feira, 4 de dezembro (19:00 \u00e0s 22:00), e no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro (15:00 \u00e0s 18:30).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, tempos limite e pontos de interesse do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento compreende duas provas cronometradas: a Corrida de 10 km (tempo limite de 2h00, integrada no Circuito Regional de Estrada da AA Santar\u00e9m) e a Corrida de 5 km (tempo limite de 1h00), passando pela Av. D. Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva, Recinto do Santu\u00e1rio de F\u00e1tima e Bas\u00edlica da Sant\u00edssima Trindade.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os valores dividem-se em 3 fases (01\/09 a 16\/10, 17\/10 a 15\/11 e 16\/11 a 01\/12\/2026): na Corrida de 10 km custam 15 \u20ac, 16 \u20ac e 17 \u20ac; na Corrida de 5 km custam 12 \u20ac, 13 \u20ac e 14 \u20ac (a 3\u00aa fase n\u00e3o inclui t-shirt).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e qual \u00e9 a causa solid\u00e1ria apoiada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do FTT \u2013 F\u00e1tima Trail Team com apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m e Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima. Por cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o validada, 2,00 \u20ac revertem integralmente a favor dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de F\u00e1tima.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Igreja e Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de F\u00e1tima\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Our\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"FTT \u2013 F\u00e1tima Trail Team\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida da S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 1\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, com aquecimento coletivo \u00e0s 18:45, partida da Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 19:00 e partida da Corrida de 5 km \u00e0s 19:10.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localizam a partida, a chegada e o secretariado da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A zona de partida e chegada situa-se junto \u00e0 Igreja e Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de F\u00e1tima, no concelho de Our\u00e9m (distrito de Santar\u00e9m). O levantamento de dorsais decorre na sexta-feira, 4 de dezembro (19:00 \u00e0s 22:00), e no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro (15:00 \u00e0s 18:30).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, tempos limite e pontos de interesse do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento compreende duas provas cronometradas: a Corrida de 10 km (tempo limite de 2h00, integrada no Circuito Regional de Estrada da AA Santar\u00e9m) e a Corrida de 5 km (tempo limite de 1h00), passando pela Av. D. Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva, Recinto do Santu\u00e1rio de F\u00e1tima e Bas\u00edlica da Sant\u00edssima Trindade.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na S\u00e3o Silvestre de F\u00e1tima 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os valores dividem-se em 3 fases (01\/09 a 16\/10, 17\/10 a 15\/11 e 16\/11 a 01\/12\/2026): na Corrida de 10 km custam 15 \u20ac, 16 \u20ac e 17 \u20ac; na Corrida de 5 km custam 12 \u20ac, 13 \u20ac e 14 \u20ac (a 3\u00aa fase n\u00e3o inclui t-shirt).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o evento e qual \u00e9 a causa solid\u00e1ria apoiada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do FTT \u2013 F\u00e1tima Trail Team com apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m e Junta de Freguesia de F\u00e1tima. Por cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o validada, 2,00 \u20ac revertem integralmente a favor dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de F\u00e1tima.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70219,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,478,47],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67472","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ourem-santarem","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-de-fatima.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67472","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/w